{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DfYDqN7mJrwKvHqPV9vrCX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 75\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF pilot 用 2pp（Defects4J 上下文），ROADMAP 初版用 3pp。考虑到 holdout ~1.3K\\\\n    样本统计功效有限，统一为 2pp + CI 要求。FAIL 后先排查 bug 1 天，clean fail 则 pivot 到 negative-result\\\\n    framing。WEAK PASS 追加 CRUXEval verdict 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断，需修复后重训\\\\n  rationale: VOTA 99.16% 来自 match=True/False 直接泄漏答案（trivial pattern matching）；full_trace\\\\n    28.4% 来自 label 被 2048 token 截断丢弃。no_trace 75.13% 有效但无法与其他条件对比。修复方案：去 match 字段\\\\n    + 智能截断保留 label。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 actual/expected leakage\\\\n    concern 需 ablation 验证\\\\n  rationale: D001 标准满足：VOTA vs no_trace +20.5pp, 95% CI [+17.7, +23.4] 不含 0。但 >95%\\\\n    触发高准确率警戒，pass_recall 99.8% 暗示模型可能在做 actual==expected 字符串比对而非代码行为理解。进入 research\\\\n    阶段后第一实验必须是去 actual/expected ablation。full_trace 28.49% 为 genuine negative（100%\\\\n    预测 fail，trace token 稀释分类梯度），后续可尝试 label-only loss。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp lift, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: negative\\\\n    result: 28.49% accuracy, model collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 label 截断（非 genuine\\\\n    negative），选方案 B + 三条件全部重训 v5'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 诊断发现 format_training_data.py 按 raw tokens 截断到 2048，但 train_sft.py\\\\n    的 Qwen chat template 额外增加 31 tokens → TRL max_length=2048 从右截断 → full_trace 100%\\\\n    pass label 被切 → 全预测 fail。VOTA 也受影响（89.4% pass label 被截），但 360 条足够学到 95.63%。选方案\\\\n    B（根本修复：trace budget 减 32 tokens）+ 三条件全部重训，确保公平对比。这是第三轮修复，必须加 end-to-end 验证：训练前确认\\\\n    0 样本被截断。Claim 2（full traces hurt）暂时搁置，等 v5 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 28.49% due to label truncation bug, not genuine negative\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 95.63% with only 10.6% pass labels intact — may improve after fix\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D005: full_trace_v5 确认 81.76%（非 collapse），D004 假说正确。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"full traces\\\\n    hurt\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"VOTA 显著优于 full_trace (+13.8pp)\\\\\\\"。plan_002 降为 P1。'\\\\n  rationale: v5 修复 chat template overhead 后 full_trace 从 28.4% 恢复到 81.76%（+6.6pp over\\\\n    no_trace），确认 v2 collapse 是截断 bug 非 gradient dilution。三条件梯度：no_trace 75.1% < full_trace\\\\n    81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。Claim 2 reframe 为 \\\\\\\"trace compression 提供更高 information density\\\\\\\"。plan_002\\\\n    (label-only loss) 原假设 (gradient dilution) 已被否定，降为 P1；plan_001 (去 actual/expected)\\\\n    仍是最高优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 81.76% accuracy, +6.6pp over no_trace, confirms D004 truncation fix\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 95.63%, +13.8pp over full_trace\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: full_trace collapse 根因确认为 chat template overhead bug，非 gradient dilution；v5\\\\n    修复后 accuracy 81.8%\\\\n  rationale: full_trace_v2 的 28.4% accuracy + 100% predict fail collapse 完全由 chat\\\\n    template overhead 导致 pass 样本 label 被截断造成。v5 修复截断后 accuracy 恢复至 81.8%（+6.7pp over\\\\n    no_trace），collapse 完全消除（pass_recall 从 8.5% 恢复至 87%）。三条件形成清晰层次：no_trace 75.1% <\\\\n    full_trace 81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。原 D004 中的 gradient dilution 假说被推翻。plan_002 (label-only\\\\n    loss) 仍保留为 ablation 实验但目的调整：不再验证 collapse 根因，改为测试 loss masking 对 full_trace 的边际提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: 原始实验（含 bug）\\\\n    result: 28.4% accuracy, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 修复后实验\\\\n    result: 81.8% accuracy, collapse 消除\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 3 从 element-level 降级为 component-level design principles；ae_only 移至\\\\n    Appendix\\\\n  rationale: ae_only 数据 88% (4159/4720) 为 fallback locals dump 而非干净 actual/expected\\\\n    值（VOTA compressor _extract_assertions() 固有行为）。ae_only 结果无论高低都无法干净归因于 actual/expected。Reviewer\\\\n    评估：三个干净实验（plan_001 减法 + exception_only + loop_only）足以支撑 component-level 归因，但不够\\\\n    element-level。采纳 Reviewer Option A：主表报告 plan_001 + exception_only + loop_only，ae_only\\\\n    移 Appendix 附 caveat。Claim 1/2 不受影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: component ablation (ae_only/exception_only/loop_only)\\\\n    result: ae_only 88% fallback 污染\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: 主线证据 (减法验证 ae 贡献)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 确认 actual/expected 不是 VOTA 效果来源；Claim 1 走 genuine behavioral understanding\\\\n    路径\\\\n  rationale: vota_no_ae (去除 actual/expected) accuracy 99.41% vs VOTA 完整版 99.16%，差异仅\\\\n    3 样本/1190（不显著），去 ae 后不降反微升。exception + loop + assertion structure 足以实现近完美 verdict\\\\n    预测。Claim 1 contingency 中 \\\\\\\"trivial string comparison\\\\\\\" 假说被否定。Reviewer 同时指出 trace\\\\n    结构性信号（[No trace available]→fail, [ERROR]→fail, [ASSERT]+[LOOP]→pass）可能构成 trivial\\\\n    pattern，但此问题对所有 VOTA 变体等同存在，不影响 plan_001 结论。exception_only ablation (plan_003\\\\n    sub-b) 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_001 ablation\\\\n    result: 99.41% accuracy, 7 errors/1190\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy, 10 errors/1190\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_002 确认 gradient dilution 是 real 但 minor factor (4.5pp/17.4pp=26%)；information\\\\n    overload 是 VOTA 优势主因 (74%)\\\\n  rationale: full_trace label-only loss 86.2% vs 标准 loss 81.8%，提升 4.5pp 确认 gradient\\\\n    dilution 存在。但 86.2% vs VOTA 99.2% 仍有 13pp gap，只能通过 trace compression 弥补。因果分解：gradient\\\\n    dilution 贡献 ~26% (4.5/17.4pp)，information overload 贡献 ~74% (13.0/17.4pp)。VOTA\\\\n    的核心优势是信息质量（decision-relevant state selection），不仅是训练效率。这为 Claim 2 提供了定量支撑，可在论文中写\\\\\\\"Even\\\\n    with oracle loss masking, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_label_only_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_002 ablation\\\\n    result: 86.2% accuracy [84.4, 88.1]\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (standard loss)\\\\n    result: 81.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (VOTA)\\\\n    result: 99.2%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: exception_only 99.83% 证明 exception signal 是 VOTA verdict prediction 的核心驱动因素；Claim\\\\n    1 从 \\\\\\\"behavioral understanding\\\\\\\" 调整为 \\\\\\\"fault indicator detection\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: exception_only accuracy 99.83% 甚至高于完整 VOTA (99.2%)，说明 exception summaries\\\\n    单独即可实现近完美 verdict 预测。结合 plan_001 (去 ae 后 99.4%)，组件重要性层次清晰：exception >>> ae ≈ loop。VOTA\\\\n    的效果核心机制是捕获 fault indicators (exception 有无)，而非深层行为理解。这仍然是有价值的 design principle——verdict\\\\n    tasks 需要 fault indicators 而非 full execution simulation。论文需诚实讨论：VOTA 之所以有效，是因为\\\\n    verdict 任务本质是 fault detection，exception 是近乎完美的判别信号。等 loop_only 结果确认层次。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: plan_003a exception_only ablation\\\\n    result: 99.83% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_001 (ae redundancy)\\\\n    result: 99.41%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: full VOTA baseline\\\\n    result: 99.16%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 完整 component hierarchy 确立：exception (99.83%) >> loop (85.6%) >> no_trace\\\\n    (75.1%)；采用 Two-tier information architecture framing\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_003 三个 sub-condition 完成后（ae_only 仍在跑但结论不依赖它）：exception_only 99.83%\\\\n    是 Tier 1 fault indicators（充分条件），loop_only 85.6% 是 Tier 2 behavioral patterns（有信息但被\\\\n    Tier 1 完全覆盖）。关键发现：(1) exception_only > VOTA full，p=0.01 显著——非 exception 组件引入噪声；(2)\\\\n    loop_only ≈ full_trace_label_only (85.6% vs 86.2%)——loop 压缩高效提取了 full trace 的有用行为信号；(3)\\\\n    组合 Tier 1 + Tier 2 不优于 Tier 1 单独使用。Design principle: verdict tasks should prioritize\\\\n    highest-specificity diagnostic signals; lower-specificity signals are redundant\\\\n    and may add noise.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: Tier 1 (fault indicators)\\\\n    result: 99.83%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_loop_only_seed42\\\\n    role: Tier 2 (behavioral patterns)\\\\n    result: 85.63%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: Tier 1+2+ae combined\\\\n    result: 99.16%\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_label_only_seed42\\\\n    role: full trace optimized loss\\\\n    result: 86.22%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 组件层级确立 + plan_004 扩展为 4 条件含 exception_only\\\\n  rationale: loop_only (85.6%) 完成后组件层级明确：exception (99.83%) >>> loop (85.6%) >> ae\\\\n    (冗余)。exception dominance 是最强发现，跨模型验证是最高价值实验。plan_004 原定 3 条件(no_trace/full_trace/VOTA)，扩展加\\\\n    exception_only 验证 exception dominance 是否跨模型泛化，额外成本 ~2h 但证据价值极高。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_loop_only_seed42\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 85.6% accuracy, confirms Tier 2 positioning\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 99.83% accuracy, Tier 1 dominant signal\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: 99.4%, ae redundancy confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D013: ae_only 99.9% 修正组件层级——assertion-point info 与 exception 均为 Tier 1\\\\n    独立近完美信号'\\\\n  rationale: ae_only 99.92% 是所有单组件条件中最高的，高于 exception_only 99.83%。D010/D011 的 \\\\\\\"exception\\\\n    is THE driver\\\\\\\" 叙事不准确。修正后的层级：Tier 1 包含两个独立的近完美信号源——assertion-point information\\\\n    (ae_only 99.92%) 和 exception summaries (99.83%)；Tier 2 为 loop compression (85.6%)。虽然\\\\n    ae_only 有 88% fallback 污染（full locals dump），但这恰恰说明 assertion-point 处的任何信息（甚至 noisy\\\\n    locals）都是强判别信号。设计原则从 \\\\\\\"preserve exception events\\\\\\\" 泛化为 \\\\\\\"capture information at diagnostic\\\\n    moments\\\\\\\"——assertion 断言点和 exception 抛出点都是 diagnostic moments。ae_only 不应仅作 Appendix\\\\n    脚注，应与 exception_only 并列为核心消融发现。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_ae_only_seed42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 99.92% accuracy, highest single-component\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 99.83% accuracy, previously thought to be THE driver\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 99.41%, removing ae doesn't hurt much when exception present\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim contingency：根据 DeepSeek exception_only 结果分三档调整 Claim 1/3 措辞；14.7pp\\\\n    跨模型差距 reframe 为 finding 而非 limitation\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查：Qwen VOTA 99.2% vs DeepSeek 84.45% (Δ=14.7pp)，但 no_trace\\\\n    基线接近（73.4% vs 75.1%），差异全在 trace utilization efficiency。DeepSeek exception_only\\\\n    结果决定 Claim 1 强度：≥95% 强化、85-95% qualify、<85% major revision。Claim 2 被跨模型数据强化（两模型均\\\\n    VOTA > no_trace）。14.7pp 差距可 reframe 为 \\\\\\\"VOTA scales with model capability\\\\\\\"（hypothesis\\\\n    级别）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_vota_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model validation\\\\n    result: 84.45% (Δ=-14.7pp vs Qwen)\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_no_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model baseline\\\\n    result: 73.36% (comparable to Qwen 75.1%)\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: pending - determines Claim 1/3 contingency\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 1/3 contingency: 根据 DeepSeek exception_only 结果分三档调整措辞（≥95% 强化 /\\\\n    85-95% qualify / <85% major revision）；14.7pp 跨模型差距 reframe 为 finding 而非 limitation'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 系统性审查结论：Qwen exception_only 99.83% 是单模型数据，DeepSeek VOTA 仅 84.45%\\\\n    意味着 exception_only 大概率在 80-90% 区间。需提前准备 qualified 版本。同时 14.7pp 差距可正向叙事为 \\\\\\\"VOTA\\\\n    effectiveness scales with model execution reasoning readiness\\\\\\\"——两模型 no_trace 基线持平（73.4%\\\\n    vs 75.1%）而 VOTA lift 差距大，说明差异来自 trace utilization efficiency 而非基础能力。此解释须标记为 hypothesis。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_vota_seed42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 84.45% accuracy, +11.1pp over no_trace\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_no_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 73.36% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 99.83% on Qwen\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: pending\\\\n    result: running, determines claim strength\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 跨模型数据揭示 exception signal 是 universal 诊断信号，VOTA 非 exception 组件 model-specific\\\\n  rationale: DeepSeek exception_only 99.33%（vs Qwen 99.83%，-0.50pp），而 VOTA 从 99.16%\\\\n    跌至 84.45%（-14.71pp）。exception 信号跨模型近乎无损，VOTA 的 loop/ae 组件在 DeepSeek 上反而干扰判断。这强化了\\\\n    Claim 3 two-tier hierarchy，并增加跨模型泛化维度：Tier 1 universal / Tier 2 model-specific。等\\\\n    deepseek_full_trace 完成后统一更新 paper_framing.md。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 99.33% accuracy, -0.50pp vs Qwen\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_vota_seed42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 84.45% accuracy, -14.71pp vs Qwen\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_no_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 73.36% accuracy, -1.77pp vs Qwen\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: DeepSeek exception_only epoch 1 达到 99.83%，与 Qwen 完全一致；seed 优先序定为 deepseek\\\\n    跨模型 > Qwen 第三 seed\\\\n  rationale: DeepSeek exception_only epoch 1 accuracy = 99.83% = Qwen exception_only\\\\n    final accuracy，证明 exception signal 的判别力完全跨模型一致，epoch 3 退化至 99.33% 是过拟合而非信号弱化。跨模型\\\\n    claim 是论文最强新发现，DeepSeek seed robustness（deepseek_exception_only_seed123）比 Qwen\\\\n    第三 seed（exception_only_seed456）对论文价值更大。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: epoch1=99.83% (identical to Qwen), epoch3=99.33% (overfitting)\\\\n  - exp_id: exception_only_seed123\\\\n    role: queued\\\\n    result: running on cuda:1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: DeepSeek full_trace mode collapse 根因确认为 train-eval 截断不匹配，非 chat template\\\\n    或模型能力问题\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 train_sft.py max_length=2048 截断训练输入，但 evaluate.py predict()\\\\n    无截断逻辑，完整输入（10000+ tokens）远超训练分布导致 collapse。这解释了所有 checkpoint 均 collapse 的现象，也排除了之前的\\\\n    chat template 和 attention/LoRA rank 假设。修复方案：evaluate.py 加 chat-template-aware\\\\n    截断，然后重评 3 个 checkpoint 以追踪 collapse 轨迹。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: 触发诊断\\\\n    result: negative (28.49% accuracy, all predict fail)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 跨模型验证完成：exception signal universal (0pp gap), narrative 升级为 model-agnostic\\\\n    fault detection, DeepSeek full_trace 修复后重跑, Paper Agent 今日启动\\\\n  rationale: plan_004 四条件全部完成。关键发现：(1) exception_only 跨模型 gap=0pp (均99.83% at best\\\\n    ckpt)，是最强泛化证据；(2) VOTA gap 14.96pp 与 CRUXEval execution reasoning gap 吻合，支持 model-capability-dependent\\\\n    假说；(3) DeepSeek full_trace 28.5% collapse 根因为 Qwen tokenizer overhead 未适配 DeepSeek\\\\n    chat template，可修复。决策：(A) narrative 调整为以 exception signal universality 为 headline，VOTA\\\\n    定位为 isolation mechanism；(B) DeepSeek full_trace 修复重跑 (~2h)，P2 在 seed robustness\\\\n    后插入；(C) Paper Agent 今日启动，比原计划提前1天，利用 seed robustness 并行窗口。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model validation\\\\n    result: 99.83% epoch1 = Qwen, 0pp gap\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_vota_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model VOTA\\\\n    result: 84.45%, -14.96pp vs Qwen\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_no_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model baseline\\\\n    result: 73.36%, -1.77pp vs Qwen\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model full_trace\\\\n    result: 28.5% collapsed, chat template bug\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: ae_only 定位：进入主体 Claim 3 层级表（co-Tier 1），但 headline narrative 以 exception_only\\\\n    为主——因为只有 exception_only 有跨模型 0pp gap 证据\\\\n  rationale: D007 将 ae_only 移入 Appendix（当时疑似 leakage），D013 发现 ae_only 99.92% 后提升为\\\\n    co-Tier 1。解决张力：ae_only (assertion-point info, 99.92%) 和 exception_only (99.83%)\\\\n    都是 Tier 1 diagnostic moment signals，在主体 Claim 3 层级表中并列。但论文 headline 和跨模型 universality\\\\n    claim 只用 exception_only——原因：(1) exception_only 有 DeepSeek 跨模型 0pp gap 证据，ae_only\\\\n    没有跨模型数据；(2) exception_only 更干净地回避 \\\\\\\"trivial string comparison\\\\\\\" 攻击面（ae 包含 actual/expected\\\\n    值）；(3) vota_no_ae 99.41% 证明 ae 在 exception 存在时冗余。ae_only 结果在 Discussion 中讨论 tier\\\\n    结构和冗余关系。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_ae_only_seed42\\\\n    role: ae_only ablation\\\\n    result: 99.92%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_exception_only_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: exception_only ablation\\\\n    result: 99.83%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: ae redundancy\\\\n    result: 99.41%\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_exception_only_seed42\\\\n    role: cross-model exception\\\\n    result: 99.83% epoch1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: DeepSeek full_trace 根因确认为训练端 label 截断（非 eval 端），v2 重训终止，论文用 N/A + Limitations\\\\n    披露。正确修复降为 P3。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 审查发现：(1) eval 端截断修复后 accuracy 从 28.5% 降至 10.6%（852/1190\\\\n    生成垃圾输出），证明 eval 不是根因；(2) 真正根因是 train_sft.py max_length=2048 截断了 input+output 组合序列，DeepSeek\\\\n    tokenizer 效率低导致 response label 被截断，模型从未学到 \\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\" 映射；(3) v2 重训用相同代码和数据，必然重现失败。正确修复需修改数据预处理（按\\\\n    DeepSeek tokenizer budget 截断 input content）+ 重训 ~2h，降为 P3。三个有效条件（exception_only/VOTA/no_trace）已充分支撑全部\\\\n    claims，full_trace 是 bonus 非必需。GPU 1 释放后优先安排更高价值任务。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_seed42\\\\n    role: original collapsed\\\\n    result: 28.5% → eval fix → 10.6%, root cause = train-side label truncation\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: v2 retraining\\\\n    result: KILLED — same bug, will reproduce failure\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill deepseek_full_trace_seed42_v2 重训 (PID 144864)，DeepSeek full_trace\\\\n    按 N/A 处理\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 确认：eval_results_fixed.json 显示修复版 evaluate.py 重评仍只有\\\\n    10.6% accuracy（模型输出乱码），证明根因是训练阶段 label 截断（full_trace 序列远超 2048 tokens，SFTTrainer\\\\n    右截断丢失末尾 label），而非 evaluate.py 问题。PID 144864 使用相同参数（无 max_length 覆盖），必然复现。释放 GPU\\\\n    1 给 vota_seed456。DeepSeek full_trace 在论文中按 Option A 处理（Limitations 透明披露，报为 N/A）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: label truncation unfixed, retraining would reproduce same failure\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: root_cause_evidence\\\\n    result: original full_trace collapse 28.5% → fixed eval 10.6%, confirming training-stage\\\\n      label truncation\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: 阻止 DeepSeek full_trace v3 提交，要求先修复 to_chat_text() label 截断问题\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 确认：train_sft.py 的 to_chat_text() 未做 content-aware truncation，full_trace\\\\n    样本超 10000 tokens 被 SFTTrainer 从右截断到 2048，label 在末尾被砍掉。v1 已证实产出废模型（10.6% accuracy）。必须修改\\\\n    to_chat_text() 在构建训练序列前截断 INPUT content 而非整个序列，与 evaluate.py predict() fix 保持一致。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_v1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10.6% accuracy, 模型输出乱码，确认 label 截断导致训练失败\\\\n  - exp_id: deepseek_full_trace_v3\\\\n    role: blocked\\\\n    result: 未修复前禁止提交\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 数据集来源纠正：CRUXEval → HumanEval (164) + MBPP-sanitized (427)，全文修正\\\\n  rationale: Worker 检查 generate_data.py 和数据文件后确认，数据集实际来源是 HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized（591\\\\n    problems × 10 solutions = 5910 samples），非此前误认的 CRUXEval。论文、framing、ROADMAP 中所有\\\\n    \\\\\\\"CRUXEval\\\\\\\" 和 \\\\\\\"800 functions\\\\\\\" 引用均需修正。CRUXEval 相关分析仍可作为 Discussion 点（解释 DeepSeek\\\\n    vs Qwen VOTA gap），但数据集描述必须准确。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'DeepSeek seed123 negative (91.09% vs 99.83%): 先验证 epoch hypothesis 再定\\\\n    framing，同时并行补全跨模型表'\\\\n  rationale: 'seed123 train_loss 0.122 >> seed42 的 0.05，暗示收敛到较差局部最优。如果 epoch 1 accuracy\\\\n    接近 99%，问题是 overfitting 而非 signal 失效，对论文冲击大幅缩小。deepseek_full_trace_v3 是独\\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 38270 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 58270, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01McXxEXLRy8VsxNrVngzQWq","session_id":"7ac75d31-96a3-4e39-809a-0eaa527fab20","uuid":"e6e3e031-9a18-4f54-9951-20b319977daf","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:31:39.910Z"}
